    "unresolvedBracketExplanation": "These programs' sgs-values.json seeds don't cover every INPUT/OUTPUT/FILEIN/FILEOUT bracket key referenced in FILE-CONTROL/FD - the raw bracket is preserved and the field is null rather than guessed."
